{"word":"λέσχη","uri":"leschê","senses":[{"word":"λέσχη","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">λέσχη,</span></span> <span class=\"gens\">ης</span>\n<span class=\"art\">(<span class=\"grec\">ἡ</span>)</span> lieu de\nréunion et de conversation, <span class=\"ital\">particul.</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> <span class=\"ital\">sorte\nde parloir ou de lieu d’asile où les voyageurs, les mendiants,\npouvaient passer la nuit,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Od.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">18, 329 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hés.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">O.</span> <span class=\"refch\">491, 499</span>\n||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> lieu couvert,\n<span class=\"ital\">sorte de portique ou de galerie, où les\nhabitants d’une ville pouvaient se réunir pour passer le\ntemps,</span> <span class=\"ital\">particul.</span> <span class=\"ital\">à Sparte et dans les cités doriennes,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Crat.</span> (<span class=\"aut\">Ath.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">138</span><span class=\"refpb\">e</span>) ; <span class=\"aut\">Plut.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Lyc.</span> <span class=\"refch\">16, 24, 25 ;</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">M.</span>\n<span class=\"refpa\">298</span><span class=\"refpb\">d</span>,\n<span class=\"refpa\">412</span><span class=\"refpb\">d</span> ;\n<span class=\"ital\">la</span> <span class=\"grec\">Λέσχη</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">de Delphes était ornée de peintures de\nPolygnote,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Luc.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Im.</span> <span class=\"refch\">7 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Paus.</span> <span class=\"refch\">10, 25, 1</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">3</span> <span class=\"ital\">p.\nsuite,</span> entretien, conversation, causerie, <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">9, 71 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Anth.</span> <span class=\"refch\">13, 6 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Poèt.</span> (<span class=\"aut\">Ath.<